    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_string_to_offset_table" kindref="compound">StringToOffsetTable</ref> - This class uniques a bunch of nul-terminated strings and keeps track of their offset in a massive contiguous string allocation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It can then output this string blob and use indexes into the string to reference each piece. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
